{
  "uid": "factory-cilium-drops",
  "title": "Cilium drops",
  "description": "What Cilium drops and why. Hubble's drop counters carry the source and destination namespaces; POLICY_DENIED is the cluster-wide default-deny (projects/platform-factory/network-policy/). Find the flows with hubble observe --verdict DROPPED.",
  "tags": [
    "factory"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
